    {
      "id": 4,
      "sentence": "For nearly two years, the family of Bipin Joshi, a Nepali student who was abducted by Hamas from a southern Israeli settlement on Oct. 7, 2023, has waged a desperate campaign to bring him home to a remote Himalayan village thousands of miles from Israel and Gaza.",
      "paragraph_id": 1,
